  "notes": "Built by NVIDIA from Meta's Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct through block-wise distillation and neural architecture search; that cross-organisation derivation is not recorded as a relation here. The blog writes Llama 3.1-Nemotron-51B(-Instruct); the Hugging Face repository uses Llama-3_1-Nemotron-51B-Instruct. Context window not stated by NVIDIA (the card gives 8192 only as the sequence length used during distillation), so left out. The Hugging Face repository was created on 2024-09-22 (UTC), a day before the blog.",
